<blockquote>
  <p>Note: This API is only available in iOS16.4 and above—remember to add availability checks.<br />
Also, if your company’s build machine doesn’t have the latest version of Xcode, make sure to upgrade—otherwise, the build might fail because this API only exists in Apple’s iOS16 SDK and not in other SDKs.</p>
